.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.worktrees

# Claude Code's local workspace config. launch.json hardcodes an absolute
# path under one developer's home directory and points at a git worktree that
# only exists on that machine, so it is per-machine state, not project config:
# tracking it shares a username and a dev-server command that cannot work for
# anyone else. Untracked here; the file itself stays on disk.
.claude/
